origin test
hash sha256:0

rule X
  kind forbid-call
  level error
  funcs os.Exit
  in leaf gateway entry library
  reason A reason.
  source A source.

rule A
  kind only-in
  level error
  effect network
  in gateway entry
  reason A reason.
  source A source.
